# `abs` of the smallest `long` overflows.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| take 1
| project a = abs(tolong('-9223372036854775808'))
---- expected
error[DS4003]: the result of `abs` does not fit in a `long`
  --> query:3:15
  |
3 | | project a = abs(tolong('-9223372036854775808'))
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this overflowed
  |
  = note: a `long` holds whole numbers from -9223372036854775808 to 9223372036854775807
